---

Applies to `server.py` in this directory (`ob_extension/staged_ob/server.py`).

That file is a staged, modified working copy of the `Ombre Brain` MCP server
entrypoint (https://github.com/P0lar1zzZ/Ombre-Brain), kept in this repository
because it shows the integration surface the affect extension attaches to.
It is not byte-identical to any upstream release; see `NOTICE.md` at the
repository root for the exact provenance caveats and digests.
